275
00:27:11,004 --> 00:27:15,841
Oil, smoke, and
napalm for defense.

276
00:27:16,301 --> 00:27:20,804
And twin 30-millimeter
belt-fed machine
guns for offense.

277
00:27:20,889 --> 00:27:22,514
So where's the ammo?

278
00:27:22,807 --> 00:27:24,475
We get that
on race day.

279
00:27:24,559 --> 00:27:25,642
Pity.

280
00:27:25,727 --> 00:27:28,896
