bigger than your guns.

289
00:27:46,081 --> 00:27:47,831
But did I mention
the helicopters,

290
00:27:47,916 --> 00:27:49,792
and also the fact
that we're on an
island here

291
00:27:49,876 --> 00:27:51,627
